&oe=6B10575E"}, {"file_name": "Main_Custom..._10.03.2026_10-10-07.png", "id": "1314585670535535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1314585673868868_5095591396090976076_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sjwfj8-uxhEQ7kNvwE3j0-t&_nc_oc=AdpeRpjfOq47XU1wbk4hRGIgvJwF0gHkSUgs6-1tigKvT6dxD2Q2TKpv5LogoolQS-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUWHwmQapAXUOU45os6O8DBhvgCt8RVQ_v_QsGvBK0C9g&oe=6B105A74"}, {"file_name": "Main_Custom..._10.03.2026_10-10-27.png", "id": "5062945987300473", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_5062945993967139_3191845456349320077_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xN-omK4LMHcQ7kNvwGqF3EE&_nc_oc=AdrLp1vB4FTj6Nok8qRi0Uaxw9JVRER4Ja9i6ntVa8Ni-cJGTl1ClRMM2BvNoDZcLj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUng5Z3XkxZYJyHpEvoKgyigj6Ngi4RYKYI90Z5_Kraiw&oe=6B1065C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "KillianVR", "keywords": ["killian", "movement", "parkour", "hangout", "adventure"], "long_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR! \n\n---Things you can do in KillianVR (So Far)---\n\n- Put both hands on a wall and your camera should \"shift\" to that direction \n\n- Go to the shop located in Forest and buy cosmetics with Bamboo \n\n- You can earn Bamboo by breaking breakables in different maps\n\n- You can access the Menu by pressing the \"X\" button on your left controller\n\n- You can chat with other people and socialize \n\n- NOTE: their is so much more coming to the game, so enjoy!", "short_description": "Become a Killian and walk on walls, shop for cosmetics, explore different maps and much more in KillianVR!"}]}, "developer_name": "Killian", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iFFmMZ-ex7_ULHvjocnEn